{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vibe With Your Own Digital Ant Farm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop Ant Farm Simulator is a lightly interactive productivity app. Start each farm with a sprawling grid of dirt and some ants. Watch as they dig out tunnels and pockets and listen to cozy lo-fi beats. The game window can be fully re-sized and displayed in portrait or landscape. As well as being able to make the screen borderless, it will persist over other windows on your PC or laptop. Set it up in a corner space of the other stuff you're doing on your PC and have a digital ant farm to zone out and distract yourself with. A suite of camera control options allow you to focus on specific ants or take control yourself. The ants are fully autonomous and will dig until they are satisfied with the farm.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3874370?t=1758994228","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3874370?t=1758994228","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874370/624542c3b6ff7e44e88dcb9cdaea48024087696b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758994228","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874370/624542c3b6ff7e44e88dcb9cdaea48024087696b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758994228","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vibe With Your Own Digital Ant Farm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop Ant Farm Simulator is a lightly interactive productivity app. Start each farm with a sprawling grid of dirt and some ants. Watch as they dig out tunnels and pockets and listen to cozy lo-fi beats. The game window can be fully re-sized and displayed in portrait or landscape. As well as being able to make the screen borderless, it will persist over other windows on your PC or laptop. Set it up in a corner space of the other stuff you're doing on your PC and have a digital ant farm to zone out and distract yourself with. A suite of camera control options allow you to focus on specific ants or take control yourself. The ants are fully autonomous and will dig until they are satisfied with the farm.</p>","developers":["Beef Cat"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874370/8626e45209f9bde824d3a6a0a7abb98bbf42a992/header.jpg?t=1758994228","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Desktop Ant Farm Simulator","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 and Up<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Beef Cat"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874370/1eb4b695ef2d3672d6554e8414839a8feb02cb77/ss_1eb4b695ef2d3672d6554e8414839a8feb02cb77.1920x1080.jpg?t=1758994228","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874370/1